{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">國家主席習近平抵達印度新德里金磚國家領導人峰會會場。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今次是習近平時隔七年再次到訪印度，金磚國家成員國包括中國、俄羅斯、巴西、印度、南非、埃及、伊朗、印尼和阿聯酋等。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_LIVE XI ARRIVAL..jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026e8moJiRrGi1789204746.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_LIVE XI ARRIVAL..jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T09:38:21.087744+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}